{"seq":3,"slug":"actors","title":"Actors 行为体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/concurrency/actors","wordCount":771,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"actors-行为体\">Actors 行为体</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Actor 是 Swift 5.5 引入的并发安全类型（SE-0306），它通过**隔离（isolation）**机制保护其内部状态，确保同一时间只有一个任务访问 actor 的可变状态。Actor 消除了传统并发编程中手动管理锁和同步的需要，将数据竞争的防护提升到语言层面。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    ACTOR[&quot;Actor&quot;] --&gt; ISO[&quot;Actor 隔离&quot;]&#10;    ACTOR --&gt; MA[&quot;MainActor&quot;]&#10;    ACTOR --&gt; GA[&quot;全局 Actor&quot;]&#10;    ACTOR --&gt; NI[&quot;nonisolated&quot;]&#10;    ACTOR --&gt; RE[&quot;重入性&quot;]&#10;    ISO --&gt; SERIAL[&quot;串行化访问&quot;]&#10;    ISO --&gt; AWAIT[&quot;跨隔离边界需 await&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    ACTOR[\"Actor\"] --&gt; ISO[\"Actor 隔离\"]\n    ACTOR --&gt; MA[\"MainActor\"]\n    ACTOR --&gt; GA[\"全局 Actor\"]\n    ACTOR --&gt; NI[\"nonisolated\"]\n    ACTOR --&gt; RE[\"重入性\"]\n    ISO --&gt; SERIAL[\"串行化访问\"]\n    ISO --&gt; AWAIT[\"跨隔离边界需 await\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Actor 是 Swift 5.5 引入的<strong>并发安全类型</strong>（SE-0306），它把「保护可变状态」从手动加锁提升为语言级保证：同一时间只允许一个任务访问 actor 的可变状态，跨隔离边界的访问被编译器强制要求 <code>await</code>。围绕它有几个关键概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Actor 隔离</strong>——actor 的属性与方法默认被隔离，串行化访问，从外部访问需 <code>await</code>；</li>\n<li><strong><code>@MainActor</code></strong>——特殊的全局 actor，确保代码在主线程执行，是 UI 更新的标准方式；</li>\n<li><strong>全局 Actor</strong>——<code>@globalActor</code> 自定义隔离域，把分散的代码统一到同一隔离边界；</li>\n<li><strong><code>nonisolated</code></strong>——让方法脱离隔离可同步调用，但只能访问不可变状态（<code>let</code>）；</li>\n<li><strong>重入性（Reentrancy）</strong>——actor 方法在 <code>await</code> 挂起时会让出，其他任务可进入，因此 <code>await</code> 前后状态可能变化，必须重新校验。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括：<strong>actor 用隔离和串行化消灭数据竞争，但重入性要求你在每个 <code>await</code> 后重新验证状态。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"actor-基础\">Actor 基础</h2><p>Actor 的声明类似 class，但所有属性和方法默认被隔离：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"actor BankAccount {&#10;    let accountNumber: String&#10;    private(set) var balance: Double&#10;&#10;    init(accountNumber: String, initialBalance: Double) {&#10;        self.accountNumber = accountNumber&#10;        self.balance = initialBalance&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func deposit(_ amount: Double) {&#10;        balance += amount&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func withdraw(_ amount: Double) throws -&gt; Double {&#10;        guard balance &gt;= amount else {&#10;            throw BankError.insufficientFunds&#10;        }&#10;        balance -= amount&#10;        return amount&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">actor</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BankAccount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accountNumber: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">accountNumber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">initialBalance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.accountNumber </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accountNumber</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> initialBalance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deposit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> withdraw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        guard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            throw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BankError.insufficientFunds</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>从外部访问 actor 的隔离成员必须使用 <code>await</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"let account = BankAccount(accountNumber: &quot;001&quot;, initialBalance: 1000)&#10;&#10;await account.deposit(500)&#10;let withdrawn = try await account.withdraw(200)&#10;print(await account.balance)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BankAccount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">accountNumber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">initialBalance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">deposit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> withdrawn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">withdraw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account.balance)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"actor-隔离机制\">Actor 隔离机制</h2><p>Actor 保证其内部状态的串行化访问——多个并发任务对同一 actor 的访问会被自动排队：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant T1 as Task 1&#10;    participant T2 as Task 2&#10;    participant A as BankAccount Actor&#10;    T1-&gt;&gt;A: await deposit(100)&#10;    Note over A: 执行 deposit&#10;    T2-&gt;&gt;A: await withdraw(50)&#10;    Note over A: Task 2 等待&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;T1: 完成&#10;    Note over A: 执行 withdraw&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;T2: 完成\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant T1 as Task 1\n    participant T2 as Task 2\n    participant A as BankAccount Actor\n    T1-&gt;&gt;A: await deposit(100)\n    Note over A: 执行 deposit\n    T2-&gt;&gt;A: await withdraw(50)\n    Note over A: Task 2 等待\n    A-&gt;&gt;T1: 完成\n    Note over A: 执行 withdraw\n    A-&gt;&gt;T2: 完成</pre><p>编译器在编译时检查隔离边界：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"actor Counter {&#10;    var count = 0&#10;&#10;    func increment() {&#10;        count += 1&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;let counter = Counter()&#10;&#10;// ✅ 从 async 上下文中通过 await 访问&#10;Task {&#10;    await counter.increment()&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ❌ 编译错误：不能从非隔离上下文同步访问&#10;// counter.count += 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">actor</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Counter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Counter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 从 async 上下文中通过 await 访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counter.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 编译错误：不能从非隔离上下文同步访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// counter.count += 1</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"mainactor\">MainActor</h2><p><code>@MainActor</code> 是一个特殊的全局 actor，它确保代码在主线程上执行，是 UI 更新的关键机制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"@MainActor&#10;class ViewModel: ObservableObject {&#10;    @Published var users: [User] = []&#10;    @Published var isLoading = false&#10;&#10;    func loadUsers() async {&#10;        isLoading = true&#10;        do {&#10;            users = try await userService.fetchAll()&#10;        } catch {&#10;            print(&quot;Failed to load: \\(error)&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;        isLoading = false&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@MainActor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ViewModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ObservableObject </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @Published</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark: